### How to talk to the live editor from main

BOB scripts default to `http://127.0.0.1:30010`. That is **wrong** for this seat. Override every Remote Control call to:

```text
http://house-victoria:30010
```

Example (Python in the already-open editor):

```powershell
$body = @{
  objectPath = "/Script/Engine.Default__KismetSystemLibrary"
  functionName = "ExecuteConsoleCommand"
  parameters = @{
    WorldContextObject = "/Engine/Transient.UnrealEditorEngine_0"
    Command = "py C:/Users/kurtw/Soul_Core/tools/ue_nav/set_pie_player_pawn.py"
    SpecificPlayer = $null
  }
  generateTransaction = $false
} | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 6
Invoke-WebRequest http://house-victoria:30010/remote/object/call -Method PUT -Body $body -ContentType 'application/json'
```

Heal sticky `:8888` (TCP up, handshake dead): `hv.stop` → wait ~2s → `hv.start` → **PIE must be running**. Do not restart SoulCore Host on `:7700` for a body heal.

